---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pole Rentals"
  description="Pole rental information for Arizona Pole Vault Academy athletes via the PVR app — live inventory, meet checkout, and monthly rentals."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Equipment</p>
      <h1>Pole Rentals</h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 55ch">
        Rent and check out poles through the PVR app. Call Garrett for questions about sizing and availability.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        AZPVA maintains a large on-site pole fleet. We use the
        <strong>PVR (Pole Vault Rental)</strong> app for checkouts and rentals.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a
          class="btn btn-primary"
          href="https://pv-rental.web.app/live-inventory/747d588871264423a46bf458cf42414a"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Live pole inventory
        </a>
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Flex numbers on the live inventory use the AZPVA “Gurt” flex scale and may differ from manufacturer flex.
        Contact us if you need an actual flex reading.
      </p>

      <h2>Rental options (via PVR)</h2>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li><strong>3-day rental:</strong> Non-club members renting for a single meet — $30 / pole</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Meet checkout (Elite members only):</strong> First 3 poles free; each additional pole 50% off
          standard ($15 / pole). Coupon code posted in the gym for Elite members.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Monthly rental:</strong> $99 / month for any pole with free, unlimited exchanges</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Checkout timing</h2>
      <p>
        Ideal checkout time is between club sessions on vault days — typically Tuesday / Thursday around 6pm.
        If that doesn’t work, contact a coach to arrange another time.
      </p>

      <h2>Returns</h2>
      <p>
        A PVR Tag is posted on the side of the gym by the turf. Check poles in from the app, then tap your phone
        to the tag to confirm you’re at the facility. Place successfully checked-in poles in the designated turf pile.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Elite meet checkouts: poles checked out for a meet must be returned by the next practice session after your meet.
      </p>

      <h2>Contacts & apps</h2>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li>Pole / PVR questions: Garrett Starkey — <a href="tel:+18058352811">(805) 835-2811</a></li>
        <li>Academy phone: <a href="tel:+14807666017">(480) 766-6017</a></li>
        <li>
          PVR on
          <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pvr/id1658829520" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">iOS</a>
          /
          <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hkaras19.pvr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Android</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
